{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922020547_38869e05","chunk_index":10,"job_id":"mwjob_8447f85a17afe47f1dddc26c","precondition_digest":"7349d025237003fc2a71649e47dc3f181ea6e6f1b327c41c9a0c64a4929460d8","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v6","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_95ab531d6c19c056","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_35edfc4291166f83","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_fa330c66e63604ee","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_37da318610b32464"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922020547_38869e05","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"筛选期与基线","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认事实支持：筛选期最长4周；入选标准包括年龄≥18岁、确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月、筛选及基线PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3，且适合接受系统治疗或光疗；排除标准包括非斑块型银屑病为主要表现、活动性严重感染、妊娠或哺乳期及研究者判断不适合参加；筛选后于基线/第1天随机，PASI和sPGA于基线评价。医学作者需核对筛选期和基线访视的完整检查项目、时间窗及操作顺序。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_95ab531d6c19c056","section_number":"7.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:667308046161e61dde1dde74","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922020547_38869e05","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"治疗期及随访","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认事实支持：双盲治疗期16周；试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服、每日一次，第1天至第16周，对照组接受匹配安慰剂每日一次；依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价；安全性随访期4周，第20周进行安全性随访；安全性终点包括TEAE、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件，以及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。医学作者需核对访视时间窗、安全性评估清单、AE/SAE报告流程和合并用药管理规则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_35edfc4291166f83","section_number":"7.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:667308046161e61dde1dde74","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922020547_38869e05","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"计划外访视","missing_source_classes":["计划外访视触发与评估规程","计划外访视记录与数据采集要求","计划外访视相关安全性报告流程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"允许来源仅确认计划访视安排：筛选期最长4周，双盲治疗期第2、4、8、12、16周访视，第20周安全性随访；未提供计划外访视的触发情形、评估项目、时间安排、记录载体及分析处理规则。医学作者需补充计划外访视相关项目来源或职能确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_fa330c66e63604ee","section_number":"7.1.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:667308046161e61dde1dde74","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922020547_38869e05","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"研究治疗终止、退出研究及失访处理","missing_source_classes":["研究治疗终止标准与处理流程","退出研究评估与随访安排","失访判定与追踪规程","停药后安全性随访与报告要求"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"允许来源确认安全性随访期为4周、第20周进行安全性随访，安全性终点包括导致停药的不良事件，并说明停药或使用救援治疗在主要估计目标中按无应答处理；但未提供研究治疗终止标准、退出研究评估、失访定义与追踪、停药后随访安排及数据职责。医学作者需补充相应项目来源或职能确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_37da318610b32464","section_number":"7.1.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:667308046161e61dde1dde74","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:667308046161e61dde1dde74","source_id":"protocol_fu